  <ifrs-full:InformationAboutMajorCustomers contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_GeographicalAreasAxis_entity00126371_ChinaAndSoutheastAsiaMemberOfGeographicalAreasDomainOfDisclosureOfGeneralInformationOfGeographicalAreasTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">삼성전자, Xiaomi, Tesla 등</ifrs-full:InformationAboutMajorCustomers>
  <ifrs-full:InformationAboutMajorCustomers contextRef="CFY2026dHYA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_MajorCustomersAxis_entity00126371_SamsungElectronicsCoLtdAndItsSubsidiariesMemberOfMajorCustomersDomainOfDisclosureOfMajorCustomersTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사의 당반기 매출(중단영업 포함)에서 차지하는 비중이 10% 이상인 거래처는 삼성전자와 그 종속기업이며, 당반기 해당 거래처에 대한 매출은 17,108억원입니다.</ifrs-full:InformationAboutMajorCustomers>
